00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:03.136 size:53% position:73% line:53%
YASMINE MEHDI

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:04.037 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'accès à Fort Myers reste

00:00:02.603 --> 00:00:04.905 size:53% position:73% line:53%
