00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.985 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ici, avec une connexion

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:18.018 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cellulaire hasardeuse,

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:18.051 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des milliers de personnes qui

00:00:18.452 --> 00:00:23.323 size:53% position:73% line:53%
