00:00:23.657 --> 00:00:25.959 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'eau potable ou

00:00:24.525 --> 00:00:26.827 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'essence. Et pendant

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:29.496 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que les résidents de Fort Myers

00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:30.330 size:53% position:73% line:53%
