00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:56.283 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mine Mehdi,

00:01:55.282 --> 00:01:56.283 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada, à Fort Myers,

00:01:56.283 --> 00:02:01.283 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 en Flor

